358 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 197 0 R
/E (Eliminated the glove entirely. A USB camera feeds hand landmark data to MediaPipe's pre-trained deep learning model on a host PC, extracting 21 landmarks per frame in real time. A Python script maps landmark positions to 6 servo angles and transmits via UART to a single ESP32, which drives the robotic hand. This gave reliable, contact-free, real-time gesture control with no damaged hardware dependencies.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
